        "thought_text": "The current approach incorrectly generates a number with all same digits starting from the first digit of N, which fails when N has digits that are not all the same. Instead, we should generate the smallest number with all same digits greater than or equal to N by incrementing the first digit of N and filling the rest with that digit.",
