        "thought_text": "Instead of checking if N is already a same-digit number, we should generate the smallest number with all same digits greater than or equal to N by incrementing the first digit of N and filling the rest with that digit. This approach ensures that we find the earliest ABC where Kurohashi can make his debut, even when N has digits that are not all the same.",
