        "thought_text": "The current approach incorrectly handles cases where incrementing the first digit of N results in a number with all same digits that is still less than N. Instead, we should generate the smallest number with all same digits greater than N by incrementing the first digit of N and filling the rest with that digit, or by incrementing the first digit and filling the rest with zeros if that results in a number less than or equal to N. This ensures that we find the earliest ABC where Kurohashi can make his debut.",
